{"resourceIdentifier":"4110","resourceName":"Henan Luoning IFM (conversion of logged to protected forest) Project","description":"Henan Luoning IFM (conversion of logged to protected forest) Project (hereafter referred as “the\r\nproject”) is located in Luoning County, Luoyang City, Henan Province, China. The project is to\r\nprotect forest from logging to generate GHG emission reductions and contribute to local\r\nsustainable development. Before the implementation of the project activity, the trees are logged\r\nbased on a government-approved timber management plan for harvesting the project area. The\r\nimplementation of the project activity converses the trees to protected forest to reduce the GHG\r\nemissions.\r\nThe project type is “Improved Forest Management: Logged to Protected Forest (LtPF)”. The\r\nproject start date is 01/04/2020, and the project area is 9,451.55 ha. The species of this project\r\nare Robinia, Chinese pine, Hard Broad and Cypress.\r\nWith the implementation of the project activity, total GHG emission reductions or removals are\r\nabout 4,118,556 tCO2e in 30 years the average annual emission reduction is 137,285 tCO2e and\r\ntotal GHG emission reductions or removals with buffer deduction is about 3,212,467 tCO2e in 30\r\nyears, the average annual GHG emission reductions or removals with buffer deduction is 107,082\r\ntCO2e.","location":{"latitude":34.374127,"longitude":111.182224},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-04-10","endExclusive":"2023-05-11","endInclusive":"2023-05-10"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4110"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Zhejiang Zhongzheng Forestry Development Co.,Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Zhejiang, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 138 5704 6666"},{"type":"string","value":"770126@zzforestry.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Rejected by Administrator"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"78666"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"IFM"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0010"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"9451 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/04/2020 - 31/03/2050"}]}]},{"programCode":"CCB","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Zhejiang Zhongzheng Forestry Development Co.,Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Zhejiang, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 138 5704 6666"},{"type":"string","value":"770126@zzforestry.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Validation and verification approval request denied"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"78666"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Improved Forest Management"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"9451 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"CCB_STANDARD_EDITION_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CCB Third Edition"}]},{"code":"FIRST_VERIFICATION_VER_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"China Classification Society Certification Company (CCSC)"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=88058&IDKEY=3097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodf